# Allowlist. ~/.claude is linked to this folder, so everything Claude Code
# writes at runtime (projects, history, credentials, plugins, settings, caches)
# lands here. Ignore everything, then un-ignore only what this repo owns.
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they match only at this level.
*

!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/flow.md
!/README.md

# Own skills only. Third-party skills installed into skills/ stay ignored.
!/skills/
!/skills/merged/
!/skills/merged/**
!/skills/recall-notes/
!/skills/recall-notes/**
!/skills/sync-flow/
!/skills/sync-flow/**

# The folders exist after clone; their contents are private and ignored.
!/work/
!/work/.gitkeep
!/oss/
!/oss/.gitkeep
